      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge-fault\">失敗</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge-fault{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm,4px);background:rgba(239,68,68,.12);color:var(--error-text,#f87171);font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",-apple-system,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Nav Item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item-active",
      "description": "active 狀態是 15% 強調色淡洗，絕不實心填滿。此處展示的是 active 狀態。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-item-active\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>設定</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:var(--radius-md,8px);color:var(--text-muted,#a0aabe);font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",-apple-system,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--bg-tertiary,#2e3b56);color:var(--text-primary,#f2f2f2)}.ds-nav-item-active{background:rgba(59,130,246,.15);color:var(--text-primary,#f2f2f2);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus-ring,#3b82f6);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "活動中心背後的招牌模式。圖示晶片、標題、原因說明、右側槽。右槽在沒有真實進度時顯示「進行中」——而且完全不渲染進度條，不是渲染一條空的。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-status-row\"><div class=\"ds-status-chip\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-status-text\"><div class=\"ds-status-title\">字幕生成中</div><div class=\"ds-status-detail\">龍族前傳 S03E01</div></div><span class=\"ds-status-right\">進行中</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-status-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg,12px);background:var(--bg-secondary,#24304a);font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",-apple-system,sans-serif}.ds-status-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:var(--radius-md,8px);background:var(--bg-tertiary,#2e3b56);color:var(--text-secondary,#b3b3b3)}.ds-status-text{min-width:0;flex:1}.ds-status-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary,#f2f2f2)}.ds-status-detail{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary,#b3b3b3);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.ds-status-right{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary,#b3b3b3);flex-shrink:0}"
    }
  ],
